{
    "word": "rgb",
    "lang_code": "en",
    "source_file_to_entries": {
        "raw-wiktextract-data.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "9bcead3d-41ad-3616-a23a-ae696f08afef",
                "word": "RGB",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "1fe0e2ed-9c6e-3d05-ada0-bccced2273d4",
                        "entry_id": "9bcead3d-41ad-3616-a23a-ae696f08afef",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Initialism of red, green, blue; a color model in which colors are represented by adding varying amounts of red, green, and blue light."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "abbreviation",
                            "alt-of",
                            "initialism",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "5a4be7e5-a991-3c5e-b5c5-52cccf21bee2",
                        "entry_id": "9bcead3d-41ad-3616-a23a-ae696f08afef",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Something extending across the RGB color space; (especially) something having a wide variety of vivid colors."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "attributive",
                            "broadly",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "66449dd0-f95c-4bee-b464-eef7d55566bf",
                                "sense_id": "5a4be7e5-a991-3c5e-b5c5-52cccf21bee2",
                                "text": "RGB wallpaper"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f21bd10d-d379-4a40-a62b-0f0ce32c0c7a",
                                "sense_id": "5a4be7e5-a991-3c5e-b5c5-52cccf21bee2",
                                "text": "You're about to get lost in the RGB forest and make sensory associations you would never think of in Oscar López Rocha's animation Synesthetic Locked."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c1d2c035-98b1-4051-8d4a-a61afb6a218b",
                                "sense_id": "5a4be7e5-a991-3c5e-b5c5-52cccf21bee2",
                                "text": "This threshold of expectations is promptly forgotten in the RGB world of in-game tactical menus in web-friendly, tightly-kerned sans serifs."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "30f19703-bcfd-41f4-9f05-af7be05c7fe1",
                                "sense_id": "5a4be7e5-a991-3c5e-b5c5-52cccf21bee2",
                                "text": "Destiny 2 newest shader adds an RGB effect to the player's equipment"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "ad7281b1-d341-3804-9e74-3327c99dcd36",
                        "entry_id": "9bcead3d-41ad-3616-a23a-ae696f08afef",
                        "glosses": [
                            "RGB lighting; lights (especially LEDs) able to display a wide range of colors by being able to individually adjust the strength of the red, green, and blue channels."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "broadly",
                            "slang",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "31ca089f-ce9a-428d-a153-97f4b6f52d35",
                                "sense_id": "ad7281b1-d341-3804-9e74-3327c99dcd36",
                                "text": "An RGB keyboard"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "48f58bf3-0710-412f-ae07-84667b997441",
                                "sense_id": "ad7281b1-d341-3804-9e74-3327c99dcd36",
                                "text": "The earcups are light aluminum with a classy silver look, accented by an RGB-lit Corsair logo in the center."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ef944787-d0d7-4c4e-980c-618247648d42",
                                "sense_id": "ad7281b1-d341-3804-9e74-3327c99dcd36",
                                "text": "Its next step seems to be gaming, as new code changes hint at full RGB support for keyboards, because we all know the more RGB you have on your computer, the better your frame rates will be."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "8898af40-41e3-4834-ac49-81abafc6b785",
                                "sense_id": "ad7281b1-d341-3804-9e74-3327c99dcd36",
                                "text": "So if lots of RGB isn't extremely high on your list of wants, this case doesn't make sense. This is a case for RGB fanatics who don't mind paying a high price for a whole lot of color-controlled glow."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ee52eca4-75f1-41ac-a25c-2b2cb2e22b93",
                                "sense_id": "ad7281b1-d341-3804-9e74-3327c99dcd36",
                                "text": "As a result, the LL120s are the brightest and showiest fans we tested and a perfect fit for any RGB addict."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "f1388a61-1fd4-46a1-8fca-b5e35fafe657",
                        "source_entry_id": "9bcead3d-41ad-3616-a23a-ae696f08afef",
                        "source_sense_description": "red, green, blue",
                        "target_lang_word": "RVB",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "RVB",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "349a4954-b65c-3488-9637-de2267724f32",
                                        "entry_id": "21a9e57e-3303-3a23-9f05-e3135c3c2063",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Espace colorimétrique où chaque point représentant une couleur a trois valeurs des couleurs primaires : du rouge, du vert et du bleu."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "bf38e985-817c-3fab-a4ec-174833d546cf",
                                        "entry_id": "21a9e57e-3303-3a23-9f05-e3135c3c2063",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Structure d’écran, de capteur, d’image numérique, etc. qui a plusieurs pixels chacun composé de trois sous-pixels rouge, vert et bleu."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "RVB",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8e3d1f93-b800-3088-8770-cfabae55a47f",
                                        "entry_id": "361e58ef-c2f8-3225-bb94-ad8a7bfd9503",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Chantier consistant au remplacement intégral de la voie (rails et traverses) et du ballast."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f7b730f0-8ec6-4fb7-a490-6a1c03d04f63",
                                                "sense_id": "8e3d1f93-b800-3088-8770-cfabae55a47f",
                                                "text": "Lorsque l’état d’une ligne se dégrade suite aux outrages du temps et des passages de trains, la voie doit être rénovée ou même changée. Plusieurs cas de figure sont possibles : un simple remplacement des traverses trop détériorées, le remplacement des rails, allant jusqu’au RVB complet, le « renouvellement voie et ballast »."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
